        "quiz_id": 2167,
        "type": "writing",
        "title": "Some people think that museums should be enjoyable places to entertain people, while others believe that the purpose of museums is to educate.  Discuss both views and give your own opinion.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCykd6xeVoZWPbxuCG7ldm8ugAc\"><em><strong>Some people think that museums should be enjoyable places to entertain people, while others believe that the purpose of museums is to educate. </strong></em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H2JJdODu1omVZyxGZB1lyyAlgTe\"><em><strong>Discuss both views and give your own opinion.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTzNd8mj9oUwbFx0MFilTG8bg97\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Purpose of Museums</em></p>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTzNd8mj9oUwbFx0MFilTG8bg97\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1. Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LGDQdWiIvohAS0xObhKlh062gjf\">\n<ul>\n<li>Đề b&agrave;i Purpose of Museums&nbsp;đưa ra hai quan điểm tr&aacute;i ngược về vai tr&ograve; của bảo t&agrave;ng:\n<ul>\n<li>Quan điểm 1: Bảo t&agrave;ng n&ecirc;n l&agrave; nơi giải tr&iacute; th&uacute; vị cho mọi người</li>\n<li>Quan điểm 2: Mục đ&iacute;ch ch&iacute;nh của bảo t&agrave;ng l&agrave; gi&aacute;o dục</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Đề Purpose of Museums&nbsp;y&ecirc;u cầu thảo luận cả hai quan điểm v&agrave; đưa ra &yacute; kiến c&aacute; nh&acirc;n của bạn.</li>\n<li>Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một chủ đề kh&aacute; phổ biến về vai tr&ograve; của c&aacute;c cơ sở văn h&oacute;a trong x&atilde; hội hiện đại. Bạn cần c&acirc;n nhắc cả hai kh&iacute;a cạnh gi&aacute;o dục v&agrave; giải tr&iacute; của bảo t&agrave;ng để đưa ra lập luận thuyết phục.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CaaPdALkUoj39UxqBaClSdzHg7g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2. Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Bạn c&oacute; thể đồng &yacute; với một trong hai quan điểm hoặc kết hợp cả hai. Trong b&agrave;i mẫu n&agrave;y, t&aacute;c giả ủng hộ việc kết hợp cả gi&aacute;o dục v&agrave; giải tr&iacute;, nhưng nghi&ecirc;ng về yếu tố giải tr&iacute; nhiều hơn.</li>\n<li><strong>Trong b&agrave;i n&agrave;y ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ lập luận theo c&aacute;ch Antithesis (phản đề).</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>BODY 1: Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm về vai tr&ograve; gi&aacute;o dục của bảo t&agrave;ng v&agrave; chỉ ra một số hạn chế của vai tr&ograve; n&agrave;y để dẫn qua BODY 2</li>\n<li>BODY 2: N&ecirc;u l&yacute; do tại sao bảo t&agrave;ng n&ecirc;n t&iacute;ch hợp yếu tố giải tr&iacute; v&agrave; lợi &iacute;ch của việc n&agrave;y</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O6Q8dKUwJolsRLxRHMKlYAGzgPb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3. Gợi &yacute; viết BODY 1</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ARYZdTorMo8GHUxXiaxlbgKog9K\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B3WzdXi90obr9exqY49ldT5Wg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T3vid37FgouPrLxntpAllbSOgpd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ABpydqwzqoBt8mxtA2clX4h8gmh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FRtld534aoXQ8Cxcdevl45SsgZc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OtESdRTjnoSJwzxYBWkl2MvDgXb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UaoQdMKTxottsFx5xHZl5y6dgTe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ShyKdSzwIoav15xhSR1lkgYvgiN\">Trong BODY 1, ch&uacute;ng ta sẽ tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm cho rằng bảo t&agrave;ng n&ecirc;n tập trung v&agrave;o mục đ&iacute;ch gi&aacute;o dục.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Topic sentence:</span></strong>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J2Mgd651jokGr5xFFcTlMHOagYg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YIkYdyyfZoikZgxMfM9ly4SYghh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mk2zdFhmloeQGbxZgDwlEsvwgnh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JesqdVbvXoysYjxqtf7lyoDSg7c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-S0GAd5xJ8oGcMrxuRAElpmNagXe\">Những người ủng hộ vai tr&ograve; gi&aacute;o dục của bảo t&agrave;ng c&oacute; một số lập luận hợp l&yacute;.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 1:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZSGudTTeHoUUbwxmgwvlnevNg0d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Br0HdPtt2o6yaDxssU5lFwBbgic\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CXHedb5Q5o0ChTxzjeJlACIHgBe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qw7XdcQDiopHAmxbaJzlaWDZgjb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EAA1dQKV5otLAmxFGgBlpln2gIe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N5dHdBAjeojWA3xMEbCl8pn1gyB\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IAbldxsOzoo2wFxmKA9lpeamg5g\">Bảo t&agrave;ng cung cấp cơ hội học tập thực tế (<strong>tangible learning opportunities</strong>)&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IAbldxsOzoo2wFxmKA9lpeamg5g\">&nbsp; ➜ mang lại trải nghiệm thực tế (<strong>practical experiences</strong>) ngo&agrave;i c&aacute;c nguồn kiến thức truyền thống&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IAbldxsOzoo2wFxmKA9lpeamg5g\">&nbsp; ➜ v&iacute; dụ: bảo t&agrave;ng khoa học (<strong>science museums</strong>)&nbsp;cho ph&eacute;p kh&aacute;ch tham quan tương t&aacute;c với m&ocirc; h&igrave;nh khủng long chi tiết</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IAbldxsOzoo2wFxmKA9lpeamg5g\">&nbsp; ➜ hiểu s&acirc;u hơn về lịch sử tự nhi&ecirc;n (<strong>gaining a deeper understanding of natural history</strong>)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 2:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RJW5dfJhqofjuXxEd7dlCvwzg3b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LQSEdv0Y1oIVaoxMMoxljdOvgOd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HNQNdCbCpoystuxVP43luHtDgeb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HJ7FdScShoqf2QxHEgylSbaAgyf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NFfDdmOXNoOWwZxiNtZl15SMgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A0zKdQFrWoIXtex6mhplQSoegxb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-T2mWd1rtBo8T07x6awTlNUNqg9f\">Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, chỉ dựa v&agrave;o c&aacute;c trưng b&agrave;y v&agrave; th&ocirc;ng tin viết c&oacute; thể g&acirc;y nh&agrave;m ch&aacute;n (<strong>boring and tedious</strong>)&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-T2mWd1rtBo8T07x6awTlNUNqg9f\">&nbsp; ➜ dẫn đến giảm lượng kh&aacute;ch tham quan (<strong>a decline in visitor counts</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-T2mWd1rtBo8T07x6awTlNUNqg9f\">&nbsp; ➜ ảnh hưởng đến hoạt động l&acirc;u d&agrave;i của bảo t&agrave;ng</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jo9cdHYcooaKCQxdDaTlbws2gHh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I85fdLrlqovzpLxkUCfldUM5gEg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4. Gợi &yacute; viết BODY 2</strong> </span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I85fdLrlqovzpLxkUCfldUM5gEg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FkKtdjQLbo1AtlxkzyalC6VXgEc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZT8dluWuoiebixsy4zlDBdDg8f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ub8odKVWsohu3TxKHTylRfJ3gqT\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IO0OdZMbkop2KtxaAgbl07P0g3f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ap4ndJ97bocXozxn7oAl3Txmgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FwiNdcUNSoCW0UxEnPxlYn1NgYe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lsjlde9EKo9cSdxAvmulNTZPgbd\">Trong BODY 2, ch&uacute;ng ta sẽ tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm ủng hộ việc t&iacute;ch hợp yếu tố giải tr&iacute; v&agrave;o bảo t&agrave;ng.</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Topic sentence:</span></strong></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZakddQ7nJoAgFyxpFvNleucyg4d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OBDmdoEGDoDyBgxNOqylocGigdc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PoBydy7ixoRrKIxO5gdlnQbzg7e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FPwwd6a20oL0khxlV17lQP1fgSh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-CLHQd8Vyjoq587xOQKBlr5EDg4b\">Bảo t&agrave;ng n&ecirc;n kết hợp c&aacute;c yếu tố giải tr&iacute; để mang lại gi&aacute; trị tối đa cho kh&aacute;ch tham quan v&agrave; th&iacute;ch ứng với kỳ vọng hiện đại.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 1:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OOMmd2z40oU1GpxeAiOljjORg6c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IP8udCf4UodaQ1xp6r1lvwiTgHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FWGcdCLrAodR0zx9hxultvvcg0c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" da