has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CXfQd5foZotNYvxR3yulUfOegnb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JKs3d2HFfoJfLcxOlhZlsYPPgOc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OVGzda09ioegiAxjp4BlwN6Ugee\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dc96dxi8Do6jiRxbpzIlbykXgw1\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-SmqNdAdGQozDyNxx9Ufl3QlCgZg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Việc hướng đến t&iacute;nh giải tr&iacute; (<strong>entertainment-oriented</strong>)&nbsp;gi&uacute;p bảo t&agrave;ng trở th&agrave;nh m&ocirc;i trường thuận lợi hơn để tiếp thu kiến thức (<strong>more conducive to knowledge acquisition</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-SmqNdAdGQozDyNxx9Ufl3QlCgZg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; ➜ v&iacute; dụ: tr&ograve; chơi tương t&aacute;c (<strong>interactive games</strong>), trải nghiệm thực tế ảo (<strong>virtual reality experiences</strong>), biểu diễn s&acirc;n khấu (<strong>theatrical performances</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-SmqNdAdGQozDyNxx9Ufl3QlCgZg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; ➜ đơn giản h&oacute;a c&aacute;c kh&aacute;i niệm phức tạp (<strong>complex concepts</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-SmqNdAdGQozDyNxx9Ufl3QlCgZg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; ➜ l&agrave;m triển l&atilde;m hấp dẫn hơn (<strong>more</strong> <strong>engaging</strong>) với kh&aacute;ch trẻ tuổi</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-SmqNdAdGQozDyNxx9Ufl3QlCgZg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; ➜ khơi gợi sự 